{"type":"message","id":"a4da8f36","parentId":"ad7d079b","timestamp":"2026-05-02T03:13:24.231Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"配置schema显示properties是空的，这意味着插件可能不使用传统的config配置方式。让我看看其他插件的bot配置是如何做的，比如wecom-openclaw-plugin。让我查看一下是否有专门的channels配置。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_eda6de9c02de42a1a0ce2c24","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -A 20 '\"channels\"' /workspace/projects/openclaw.json | head -30"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":137,"output":119,"cacheRead":51136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51392,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777691602285}}
{"type":"message","id":"d73a0025","parentId":"a4da8f36","timestamp":"2026-05-02T03:13:24.253Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_eda6de9c02de42a1a0ce2c24","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"channels\": {\n    \"feishu\": {\n      \"allowFrom\": [],\n      \"appId\": \"\",\n      \"appSecret\": \"\",\n      \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n      \"dmPolicy\": \"pairing\",\n      \"domain\": \"feishu\",\n      \"enabled\": false,\n      \"groupAllowFrom\": [],\n      \"groupPolicy\": \"open\",\n      \"requireMention\": true,\n      \"streaming\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"commands\": {\n    \"native\": \"auto\",\n    \"nativeSkills\": \"auto\",\n    \"ownerDisplay\": \"raw\",\n    \"restart\": true\n  },"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":11,"aggregated":"\"channels\": {\n    \"feishu\": {\n      \"allowFrom\": [],\n      \"appId\": \"\",\n      \"appSecret\": \"\",\n      \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n      \"dmPolicy\": \"pairing\",\n      \"domain\": \"feishu\",\n      \"enabled\": false,\n      \"groupAllowFrom\": [],\n      \"groupPolicy\": \"open\",\n      \"requireMention\": true,\n      \"streaming\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"commands\": {\n    \"native\": \"auto\",\n    \"nativeSkills\": \"auto\",\n    \"ownerDisplay\": \"raw\",\n    \"restart\": true\n  },","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1777691604248}}
{"type":"message","id":"397ab1a0","parentId":"d73a0025","timestamp":"2026-05-02T03:13:26.100Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我看到channels配置的结构了。feishu有一个完整的channels配置。我需要为dmwork添加类似的配置。但首先让我查看一下其他插件的README，了解DMWork的配置格式。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6efc7afd6f1d437591e6e1e4","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/extensions/openclaw-channel-dmwork/README.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":215,"output":109,"cacheRead":51264,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51588,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777691604254}}
{"type":"message","id":"f72a80e9","parentId":"397ab1a0","timestamp":"2026-05-02T03:13:26.111Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_6efc7afd6f1d437591e6e1e4","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# openclaw-channel-dmwork\n\nDMWork channel plugin for OpenClaw. Connects via DMWORK WebSocket for real-time messaging.\n\nRepository: https://github.com/yujiawei/dmwork-adapters\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js >= 18\n- OpenClaw installed and configured (`npm i -g openclaw`)\n- A bot created via BotFather in DMWork (send `/newbot` to BotFather)\n\n## Install\n\nOne-command install via npx (BotFather will provide the exact command):\n\n```bash\nnpx -y openclaw-channel-dmwork install \\\n  --bot-token bf_your_token_here \\\n  --api-url http://your-server:8090 \\\n  --account-id my_bot\n```\n\nThis will:\n1. Install the plugin via `openclaw plugins install`\n2. Configure the bot account in `channels.dmwork.accounts.<account-id>`\n3. Restart the OpenClaw gateway\n\n### Interactive install\n\nRun without arguments to be prompted for each value:\n\n```bash\nnpx -y openclaw-channel-dmwork install\n```\n\n## CLI Commands\n\n```bash\n# Update the plugin to the latest version\nnpx -y openclaw-channel-dmwork update\n\n# Diagnose plugin health\nnpx -y openclaw-channel-dmwork doctor\n\n# Uninstall (removes plugin and all bot configs)\nnpx -y openclaw-channel-dmwork uninstall\n\n# Remove a single bot account\nnpx -y openclaw-channel-dmwork remove-account --account-id my_bot\n```\n\n### OpenClaw internal commands\n\nAfter installation, these commands are available inside OpenClaw:\n\n```\n/dmwork_doctor              # Check plugin status and connectivity\n/dmwork_doctor my_bot       # Check a specific account\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nBot accounts are stored in `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` under `channels.dmwork.accounts`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"channels\": {\n    \"dmwork\": {\n      \"apiUrl\": \"http://your-server:8090\",\n      \"accounts\": {\n        \"my_bot\": {\n          \"botToken\": \"bf_your_token_here\",\n          \"apiUrl\": \"http://your-server:8090\"\n        },\n        \"another_bot\": {\n          \"botToken\": \"bf_another_token\",\n          \"apiUrl\": \"https://im.example.com/api\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nConfiguration fields per account:\n\n- `botToken` (required): Bot token from BotFather (`bf_` prefix)\n- `apiUrl` (required): DMWork server API URL\n- `wsUrl` (optional): DMWORK WebSocket URL. Auto-detected if omitted.\n- `requireMention` (optional): Only respond when @mentioned in groups\n- `historyLimit` (optional): Group chat history message limit (default: 20)\n\n## What it does\n\n1. Registers the bot with the DMWork server via REST API\n2. Connects to DMWORK WebSocket for real-time message receiving\n3. Auto-reconnects on disconnection\n4. Sends a greeting to the bot owner on connect\n5. Dispatches incoming messages to OpenClaw's message handler\n6. Supports streaming responses (start/send/end), typing indicators, and read receipts\n\n## As an OpenClaw Plugin\n\nThe `index.ts` exports a standard OpenClaw plugin object. When loaded by OpenClaw:\n\n- `register(api)` is called automatically\n- `api.runtime` is injected for logging and lifecycle management\n- `api.registerChannel()` registers the DMWork channel plugin\n- `api.registerCommand()` registers `/dmwork_doctor`\n- Configuration is read from `channels.dmwork` in OpenClaw's config\n\nThe plugin uses the `ChannelPlugin` SDK interface with support for:\n- Direct messages and group chats\n- Multi-account configuration via `channels.dmwork.accounts`\n- Config hot-reload on `channels.dmwork` prefix changes\n\n## Disconnect\n\nTo disconnect the bot, send `/disconnect` to BotFather in DMWork. This invalidates the current IM token and kicks the WebSocket connection.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777691606107}}
{"type":"message","id":"4b07474d","parentId":"f72a80e9","timestamp":"2026-05-02T03:13:30.638Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"太好了！现在我明白了DMWork插件的配置格式。根据README，bot账户需要配置在 `channels.dmwork.accounts` 下，格式如下：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"channels\": {\n    \"dmwork\": {\n      \"apiUrl\": \"http://your-server:8090\",\n      \"accounts\": {\n        \"27jPUOwvrhn619f9b05_bot\": {\n          \"botToken\": \"bf_cc5cf7f5b80632b44601414bd1d7649c\",\n          \"apiUrl\": \"https://im.deepminer.com.cn/api\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n但我还需要指定这个bot绑定到哪个agent。根据用户提供的命令 `--agent main`，这个bot应该绑定到main agent。\n\n让我查看一下配置结构，看看agent绑定是如何配置的。可能需要在accounts配置中添加agent字段。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"太好了！现在我明白了配置格式。根据README，我需要在配置文件中添加 `channels.dmwork` 配置。让我修改配置文件："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_30d18e79f1364e679fba2052","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/openclaw.json","new_string":"  \"channels\": {\n    \"feishu\": {\n      \"allowFrom\": [],\n      \"appId\": \"\",\n      \"appSecret\": \"\",\n      \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n      \"dmPolicy\": \"pairing\",\n      \"domain\": \"feishu\",\n      \"enabled\": false,\n      \"groupAllowFrom\": [],\n      \"groupPolicy\": \"open\",\n      \"requireMention\": true,\n      \"streaming\": true\n    },\n    \"dmwork\": {\n      \"apiUrl\": \"https://im.deepminer.com.cn/api\",\n      \"accounts\": {\n        \"27jPUOwvrhn619f9b05_bot\": {\n          \"botToken\": \"bf_cc5cf7f5b80632b44601414bd1d7649c\",\n          \"apiUrl\": \"https://im.deepminer.com.cn/api\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },","old_string":"  \"channels\": {\n    \"feishu\": {\n      \"allowFrom\": [],\n      \"appId\": \"\",\n      \"appSecret\": \"\",\n      \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n      \"dmPolicy\": \"pairing\",\n      \"domain\": \"feishu\",\n      \"enabled\": false,\n      \"groupAllowFrom\": [],\n      \"groupPolicy\": \"open\",\n      \"r